-up Session Held","type":"Committee"},{"date":"2026-01-07","source":"House floor actions","text":"Referred to the House Committee on Financial Services.","type":"IntroReferral"},{"date":"2026-01-07","source":"Library of Congress","text":"Introduced in House","type":"IntroReferral"},{"date":"2026-01-07","source":"Library of Congress","text":"Introduced in House","type":"IntroReferral"}],"amendments":{"items":[{"action":"On agreeing to the Rules amendment (A001) Agreed to without objection.","amends":null,"chamber":"House of Representatives","date":"2026-07-21","id":"hamdt-241","label":"H.Amdt. 241","purpose":"Pursuant to the provisions of H. Res. 1438, in lieu of the amendment in the nature of a substitute recommended by the Committee on Financial Services now printed in the bill, an amendment in the nature of a substitute consisting of the text of Rules Committee Print 119-35 is considered as adopted.","sponsor":{"bioguide_id":null,"name":null,"party":null,"state":null},"status":"Agreed to","submitted":"2026-07-21","url":"https://www.congress.gov/amendment/119th-congress/house-amendment/241"}],"total":1},"analysis_status":"analyzed","bipartisan_band":null,"chamber":"House","committees":[{"activities":[{"date":"2026-07-22","name":"Referred To"}],"chamber":"Senate","code":"ssbk00","name":"Banking, Housing, and Urban Affairs Committee","subcommittees":[]},{"activities":[{"date":"2026-07-22","name":"Unknown"},{"date":"2026-07-21","name":"Unknown"},{"date":"2026-04-20","name":"Reported By"},{"date":"2026-03-04","name":"Markup By"},{"date":"2026-01-07","name":"Referred To"}],"chamber":"House","code":"hsba00","name":"Financial Services Committee","subcommittees":[]}],"cosponsor_count":33,"fetched_at":"2026-10-25T19:34:01+00:00","history":[{"day":"2026-10-25","importance":75,"viability":69.1}],"id":"119-hr-6955","importance":75,"importance_band":"substantial","importance_detail":{"consistent":true,"dimension_mean":70.0,"dimensions":[{"assessment":"Directly affects financial